35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The timing is brutal. Forty-seven minutes for the kitchen alone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The kitchen watch confirms my suspicion. Two people do all the cooking.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The grout is back in eleven days. And ""done"" means different things to everyone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly, often buying duplicates.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants stopped speaking by year two. The chat logs show our rows start with reminders.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if two people cook, should they clean more?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, logically, yes. But the calendar shows two of us are away often.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"If ""done"" is subjective, we will always be unhappy.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"The management office charges 4,200 yen an hour. That is expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"We need a system that prevents the ""unsaid"" resentment.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,A paid service might remove the time burden entirely.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,But who pays? The invoice goes to one person.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I just want the bathroom to be predictable.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we pay, we must settle up monthly. No more guessing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A fixed rota might be too rigid for our absences.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am leaning towards paying for it.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I need to see the firm's terms first.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I agree with Minako. I am tired of guessing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am open to it if the costs are clear.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
